#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:1
msgid "Krita's elliptical selector tool reference."
msgstr "Podrobnosti o Kritinem orodju za eliptično izbiranje."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:13
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Orodja"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:13
msgid "Ellipse"
msgstr "Elipsa"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:13
msgid "Circle"
msgstr "Krog"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:13
msgid "Elliptical Select"
msgstr "Eliptični izbor"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:13
msgid "Selection"
msgstr "Izbor"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:18
msgid "Elliptical Selection Tool"
msgstr "Orodje Eliptični izbor"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:20
msgid "|toolselectellipse|"
msgstr "Orodje Eliptični izbor"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:22
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This tool, represented by an ellipse with a dashed border, allows you to "
"make :ref:`selections_basics` of a elliptical area. Simply |mouseleft| and "
"drag around the section you wish to select."
msgstr ""
"To orodje, ki ga predstavlja elipsa s pomikano obrobo, vam omogoča, da "
"naredite :ref:'selections_basics' eliptičnega območja. Preprosto |mouseleft| "
"in povlecite okoli odseka, ki ga želite izbrati."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:26
msgid ""
"Most of the behavior of the Elliptical Selection Tool is common to all other "
"selection tools, please make sure to read :ref:`selections_basics` to learn "
"more about this tool."
msgstr ""
"Večina vedenja orodja Eliptični izbor je skupna vsem drugim izbirnim "
"orodjem; glejte :ref:`selections_basics`, da izveste več o tem orodju."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:29
msgid "Hotkeys and Stickykeys"
msgstr "Hitre tipke"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:31
msgid ":kbd:`J` selects this tool."
msgstr ":kbd:`J` izbere to orodje."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:32
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"|mouseleft| :kbd:`+ Shift` constrains the selection to a perfect circle. "
"(Make sure to press |mouseleft| before :kbd:`Shift` key)"
msgstr ""
"|mouseleft| :kbd:'+ Shift' omeji izbor na popoln krog. (Prepričajte se, da "
"pritisnete |mouseleft| pred :kbd:'Shift' tipko)"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:33
msgid ""
"|mouseleft| :kbd:`+ Ctrl` makes the selection resize from the center. (Make "
"sure to press |mouseleft| before :kbd:`Ctrl` key)"
msgstr ""
"|mouseleft| :kbd:`+ krmilka` omogoča spreminjanje velikosti izbora v "
"središču (prepričajte se, da pritisnete |mouseleft| pred :kbd:`krmilko`)."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:34
msgid ""
"|mouseleft| :kbd:`+ Alt` allows you to move the selection. (Make sure to "
"press |mouseleft| before :kbd:`Alt` key)"
msgstr ""
"|mouseleft| :kbd:`+ izmenjalka` omogoča premikanje izbora (prepričajte se, "
"da pritisnete |mouseleft| pred :kbd:`izmenjalko`)."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:35
msgid ""
":kbd:`Shift +` |mouseleft| sets the subsequent selection to 'add'. You can "
"release the :kbd:`Shift` key while dragging, but it will still be set to "
"'add'. Same for the others."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`dvigalka +` |mouseleft| nastavi naslednji izbor na »dodaj«. Med "
"vlečenjem lahko spustite :kbd:`dvigalko`, vendar bo še vedno nastavljen na "
"»dodaj«. Enako za ostale."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:36
msgid ":kbd:`Alt +` |mouseleft| sets the subsequent selection to 'subtract'."
msgstr ":kbd:`Izmenjalka +` |mouseleft| nastavi naslednji izbor na »odštej«."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:37
msgid ":kbd:`Ctrl +` |mouseleft| sets the subsequent selection to 'replace'."
msgstr ":kbd:`Krmilka +` |mouseleft| nastavi naslednji izbor na »zamenjaj«."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:38
msgid ""
":kbd:`Shift + Alt +` |mouseleft| sets the subsequent selection to "
"'intersect'."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`Dvigalka + izmenjalka +` |mouseleft| določa, da se naslednji izbor "
"»preseka«."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:42
msgid ""
"Hovering your cursor over the dashed line of the selection, or marching ants "
"as it is commonly called, turns the cursor into the move tool icon, which "
"you |mouseleft| and drag to move the selection."
msgstr ""
"Lebdenje kazalca nad črtkano črto izbora (ali korakajočih mravelj, kot se "
"običajno imenuje) spremeni kazalec v ikono orodja za premikanje, ki jo |"
"mouseleft| in povlecite, da premaknete izbor."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:43
msgid ""
"|mouseright| will open up a selection quick menu with amongst others the "
"ability to edit the selection."
msgstr ""
"|mouseright| odpre hitri meni za izbor, med drugimi tudi možnost urejanja "
"izbora."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:51
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"|mouseleft| :kbd:`+ Ctrl + Alt` allows you to rotate the ellipse around the "
"marked corner of the bounding rectangle. (Make sure to press |mouseleft| "
"before :kbd:`Ctrl` and :kbd:`Alt` keys)"
msgstr ""
"|mouseleft| :kbd:'+ Ctrl + Alt' omogoča vrtenje elipse za označenim kotom "
"zveznega pravokotnika. (Prepričajte se, da pritisnete |mouseleft| pred :"
"kbd:'Ctrl' in :kbd:'Alt' tipke)"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:52
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"|mouseleft| :kbd:`+ Ctrl + Alt + Shift` allows you to rotate a constrained "
"perfect circle around the marked corner of the bounding rectangle. (Make "
"sure to press |mouseleft| before :kbd:`Ctrl + Alt + Shift` shortcut)"
msgstr ""
"|mouseleft| :kbd:'+ Ctrl + Alt + Shift' omogoča vrtenje omejenega popolnega "
"kroga okoli označenega kota zveznega pravokotnika. (Prepričajte se, da "
"pritisnete |mouseleft| pred :kbd:'Ctrl + Alt + Shift' bližnjico)"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:57
msgid ""
"To subtract a perfect circle, you can do the following: Press :kbd:`Alt +` |"
"mouseleft| shortcut, then release the :kbd:`Alt` key while dragging and "
"press :kbd:`Shift` key to constrain."
msgstr ""
"Če želite odšteti popoln krog, lahko to naredite: pritisnite bližnjico :kbd:"
"`izmenjalka +` |mouseleft|, nato spustite :kbd:`izmenjalko` med vlečenjem in "
"pritisnite :kbd:`dvigalko` za omejitev."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:61
msgid ""
"You can switch the behavior of the :kbd:`Alt` key to use the :kbd:`Ctrl` key "
"instead by toggling the switch in the :ref:`general_settings`."
msgstr ""
"Z vedenja :kbd:`izmenjalke` lahko namesto tega preklopite na :kbd:`krmilko`, "
"tako da preklopite stikalo v :ref:`general_settings`."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:65
msgid "Tool Options"
msgstr "Možnosti orodja"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:71
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Način"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:72
#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:74
msgid "This option is explained in the :ref:`pixel_vector_selection` section."
msgstr "Ta možnost je razložena v razdelku :ref:`pixel_vector_selection`."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:73
msgid "Action"
msgstr "Dejanje"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:76
msgid "Anti-aliasing"
msgstr "Glajenje robov"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:76
msgid ""
"This toggles whether or not to give selections feathered edges. Some people "
"prefer hard-jagged edges for their selections."
msgstr ""
"S tem preklopite, ali želite izbiram dati operjene robove. Nekateri imajo "
"raje trde robove za svoje izbore."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:80
msgid "Anti-aliasing is only available on Pixel Selection Mode."
msgstr "Glajenje robov je na voljo le v načinu izbire slikovnih točk."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:82
msgid "Width"
msgstr "Širina"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:83
msgid ""
"Shows you the current width while you are creating the selection. You can "
"manually type the value and use the 'Lock Width' for your next selection to "
"have the selected value."
msgstr ""
"Prikaže trenutno širino med ustvarjanjem izbora. Vrednost lahko ročno "
"vnesete in uporabite »Zakleni širino«, da bo naslednji izbor imel izbrano "
"vrednost."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:84
msgid "Lock Width"
msgstr "Zakleni širino"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:85
msgid "Forces the next selection to have the current width."
msgstr "Prisili, da ima naslednji izbor trenutno širino."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:86
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Višina"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:87
msgid ""
"Shows you the current height while you are creating the selection. You can "
"manually type the value and use the 'Lock Height' for your next selection to "
"have the selected value."
msgstr ""
"Prikaže trenutno višino med ustvarjanjem izbora. Vrednost lahko ročno "
"vnesete in uporabite »Zakleni višino«, da bo naslednji izbor imel izbrano "
"vrednost."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:88
msgid "Lock Height"
msgstr "Zakleni višino"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:89
msgid "Forces the next selection to have the current height."
msgstr "Prisili, da ima naslednji izbor trenutno višino."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:90
msgid "Ratio"
msgstr "Razmerje"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:91
msgid ""
"Shows the ratio between height and width of the selection. Similar to "
"Height, and Width, you can manually type the value and use the 'Lock Ratio' "
"for your next selection to have the selected value."
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje razmerje med višino in širino izbora. Podobno kot višino in širino "
"lahko ročno vnesete vrednost in uporabite »Zakleni razmerje« za naslednji "
"izbor, da ima izbrano vrednost."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:93
msgid "Lock Ratio"
msgstr "Zakleni razmerje stranic"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:93
msgid "Forces the next selection to have the current ratio."
msgstr "Prisili naslednji izbor, da ima trenutno razmerje."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:97
msgid "If you want your selection to be of specific size:"
msgstr "Če želite, da je vaš izbor določene velikosti:"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:99
msgid "Type the width and height."
msgstr "Vnesite širino in višino."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:100
msgid "Press the Lock Width and Lock Height buttons."
msgstr "Pritisnite gumba Zakleni širino in Zakleni višino."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/elliptical_select.rst:101
msgid "|mouseleft| where you want your selection to be."
msgstr "|mouseleft|, kjer želite, da je vaš izbor."
